        "concentrate"
      ],
      "text": "Marius specializes in using a spellcaster's own spells against them. He makes a melee attack against an enemy, dealing damage as normal. If the melee attack succeeds, he can use the Steal action to attempt to take one of the enemy's prepared spells or unused spontaneous spell slots. If successful, Marius gains a temporary spontaneous spell slot for the stolen spell until the end of his next turn. Determine the stolen spell at random from the target's spells that are 1st-rank. Innate spells, focus spells, and cantrips cannot be stolen in this manner."
